  <para style="h">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye abo muri Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efs</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete Pawulo yandikiye abo muri</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efeso</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, intumwa ya Kristo Yesu, kubera ugushaka kw’Imana,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="EPH 1:1">Ndabandikiye mwebwe abera bo muri Efeso, abizigirwa ba Kristo Yesu:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibe muri mwebwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imihezagiro yo mu buryo bw’Impwemu muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Imana, Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo iragahezagirwa, yo yaduhezagiriye ahantu ho mw’ijuru imihezagiro y’impwemu yo mu buryo bwose muri Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kuva isi itararemwa, Imana yari yaramaze kudutoranya muri Kristo, kugira ngo tube abejejwe batagira ico bagawa mu nyonga zayo. Kubera urukundo rwayo, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />yari yaramaze gufata ingingo yo kutugira abana bayo biciye kuri Yesu Kristo. Ibi ni vyo yashaka kandi vyarayinezereye. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ni co gituma duhimbaza Imana kubera ubwiza bw’ubuntu bwayo yatugiriye biciye mu Mwana wayo ikunda. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Muri we ni ho twaherewe ugucungurwa biciye mu maraso yiwe, ni kwo guharirwa ivyaha vyacu, kubera ubuntu bwayo bwinshi! <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Ubwo buntu yarabudusutseko, ibuduhana ugutahura kwose n’ubwenge bwose. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Imana yaduhaye kumenya ibanga ry’umugambi wayo, uwo yari yarateguye gushira mu ngiro, mu kugira neza kwayo, ibicishije muri Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Uwo mugambi, Imana yashatse kuwushira mu ngiro igihe yashinze gishitse. Ni uwo kwegeraniriza hamwe ibiri mw’ijuru n’ibiri kw’isi vyose ikabishira musi y’inganji ya Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ikigeretse kuri ivyo, kubera yuko twafatanijwe na Kristo, twararonse umugabane ku Mana, kuko yadutoranirije muri we kuva kera, kandi igatuma vyose bikorwa nk’uko umugambi wayo uri. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Intumbero y’Imana muri ivyo vyose, yari uko twebwe Abayuda, kuko ari twebwe twabaye aba mbere mu gushira ivyizigiro vyacu muri Kristo, duhesha Imana icubahiro. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Kandi namwe abanyamahanga mwarumvise Ubutumwa bw’ukuri, bwatumye Imana ibakiza, hanyuma mumaze kwizera Kristo, yabashizeko ikimenyetso cerekana ko muri abiwe mu kubaha Mpwemu Yera, uwo yari yarasezeranye kuva kera. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Uwo Mpwemu ni ingwati y’Imana yemeza ko tuzohabwa umugabane twasezeraniwe kandi ko yatuguze ngo tube abantu bayo. Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo tuyishime kandi tuyihe icubahiro.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isengesho Pawulo abasengera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ni co gituma, kuva numvise ukwizera Umwami Yesu kwanyu n’urukundo mukunda abantu b’Imana bose, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />sinduhuka gushimira Imana ku bwanyu. Ndabibuka uko nsenze. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Nsaba Imana yo nyene icubahiro cose, Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, Data w’ubwiza buhebuje, ngo abahe Mpwemu w’ubwenge no guhishurirwa, kugira ngo murushirize kumumenya. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Ndabasengera ngo amaso y’imitima yanyu amurikirwe kugira ngo mumenye ivyizigiro yabahaye igihe yabahamagara, n’ubwiza bwinshi bw’umugabane yateguriye abantu biwe batunganye. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Ndabasengera kandi ngo mutahure ubushobozi bw’Imana butogereranywa, bukorera muri twebwe abizera. Ubwo bushobozi ni bwo <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />yakoresheje igihe yazura Kristo ikamukura mu bapfuye, ikamwicarika mu kibanza c’iteka i buryo bwayo ahantu ho mw’ijuru, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />hejuru y’ukuganza kwose n’ubukuru bwose, hejuru y’ubushobozi n’ubutegetsi bwose, hejuru y’izina ryose rishobora kuvugwa, haba muri iyi si y’uno musi canke mw’isi izoza. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Imana yashize ibintu vyose musi y’inganji ya Kristo, imugira umutwe uri hejuru ya vyose ku bw’ineza y’Ishengero, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Iryo Shengero ni ryo mubiri wa Kristo, kandi Kristo ari muri ryo mu buryo bwuzuye, muri vyose na hose.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ubuntu ni bwo bwadukijije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Kera mwari mwarapfuye, mwishwe n’ibicumuro n’ivyaha vyanyu, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />ivyo mwagenderamwo mukurikira inzira mbi z’isi, mwumvira wa mutware w’ubwami bwo mu kirere, ni we mpwemu ikorera mu mitima y’abantu batumvira Imana. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Natwe kera twigenza nka bo, twakurikira ivy’imibiri yacu yipfuza, tugakora ivyo iyi mibiri n’imitima vyacu bishaka. Kandi muri kamere muntu kacu twari abo gucibwa urubanza n’Imana nk’abandi bose. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ariko kubera urukundo rwinshi Imana, yo mutunzi w’imbabazi, yadukunze, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />yatugiranye bazima na Kristo igihe twari tugipfuye twishwe n’ibicumuro vyacu. Ubuntu bw’Imana ni bwo bwabakijije. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kandi Imana yatuzuranye na Kristo, itwicarikana na we ahantu ho mw’ijuru muri Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />kugira ngo mu bihe bizoza ize yerekane ubutunzi bwinshi butogereranywa bw’ubuntu bwayo, ubwo yatweretse biciye mu buntu yatugiriye muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ubuntu bwayo ni bwo bwabakijije ku bw’ukwizera. Kandi n’ivyo ntivyavuye kuri mwebwe, ni ingabire y’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ntivyavuye no ku bikorwa vyiza mwakoze, kugira ngo hoye kugira umuntu n’umwe yohava yirata. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Kuko turi ibiremwa vy’Imana, yaturemye gusha muri Kristo Yesu kugira ngo dukore ibikorwa vyiza, ivyo yari yaraduteguriye gukora kuva kera.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Turi umwe muri Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Nuko mwibuke ko kera mwebwe Abanyamahanga mwitwa “abatakebwe” n’abo biyita “abakebwe” (bakebwe ku mubiri n’intoke z’abantu). <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Mwibuke ko ico gihe mwari mutandukanijwe na Kristo, mutagira ubwenegihugu muri Isirayeli kandi ata co mwiteze ku masezerano Imana yasezeranye na bo, ntimwagira ivyizigiro kandi nta Mana mwari mufise mw’isi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ariko ubu, mumaze kuba muri Kristo Yesu, mwebwe abari kure y’Imana kera mwigijwe hafi yayo biciye mu maraso ya Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kuko ni we mahoro yacu, we yakuyeho amacakubiri yari hagati y’Abayuda n’Abanyamahanga akabagira ihanga rimwe akuyeho igihome c’ubwansi cadutandukanya. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Yabikoze mu gukuraho ibikorwa vyose vyisunga amategeko n’amabwirizwa, abikuzaho umubiri wiwe. Intumbero kwari kugira ngo yiremere ubwoko bushasha akuye mu Bayuda no mu Banyamahanga, gutyo azane impore hagati yacu. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kandi abagire umubiri umwe abahuze n’Imana biciye mu rupfu rwo ku musaraba, uwo yicishije ubwo bwansi bwari hagati yabo. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Yaraje ababwira inkuru nziza y’amahoro mwebwe Abanyamahanga mwari kure, abwira amahoro n’Abayuda bari hafi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Kuko duciye kuri we, twese hamwe twaronse uburenganzira bwo gushikira Data turi muri Mpwemu umwe.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Kubera ivyo rero, mwebwe ntimukiri Abanyamahanga na ba kavantara, ariko muri abasangiye ubwenegihugu n’abera b’Imana kandi muri abo mu nzu yayo. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Mwubatswe kw’itanguriro rigizwe n’intumwa n’abavugishwa, Kristo Yesu akaba ari we buye rigumya imfuruka. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Muri we turafatanijwe neza kugira ngo tube urusengero rwejejwe rw’Umwami Imana. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kandi muri we namwe muriko murubakwa mufatanywa ngo mube Ingoro aho Imana iba biciye muri Mpwemu wayo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Umugambi uhimbaye w’Imana ku Banyamahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ku bw’ivyo, jewe Pawulo, imbohe ya Kristo Yesu ku bwa mwebwe Abanyamahanga,<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />sinkekeranya ko mwumvise ivy’igikorwa Imana yanjeje muri mwebwe co kubashikiriza ubuntu bwayo, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />kandi iryo ni ibanga nahishuriwe, nk’uko namaze kuvyandikako mu ncamake. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Nimwasoma ibi rero, muzoshobora gutahura uguhishurirwa mfise kuri iryo banga ryo muri Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />ryari ryarahishijwe abantu bo mu bihe bitandukanye vyarenganye ariko ubu rikaba ryahishuwe na Mpwemu arihishurira intumwa n’abavugishwa bera b’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Iryo banga ni iri: Abanyamahanga co kimwe n’Abisirayeli, bose iyo bizeye Ubutumwa Bwiza, basangira umugabane w’abana b’Imana. Bose bagize umubiri umwe, kandi basangiye n’isezerano ry’imihezagiro Imana yasezeranye muri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ku bw’ubuntu bwayo n’ubushobozi vyayo vyinshi, naratewe iteka ryo kuba umukozi w’ubwo Butumwa Bwiza ngo ndabukwize hose. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Naho ndi uwo hanyuma y’abera bose, ubwo buntu bw’Imana narabugiriwe, ndaronka iryo teka ryo kubwira Abanyamahanga ubutunzi butagira urugero bafise muri Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Natoranijwe kugira ngo nsigurire umuntu wese ivy’iryo banga ryari ryarahishijwe n’Imana, Umuremyi wa vyose, kuva mu bihe vya kera. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Intumbero y’Imana muri ivyo vyose, kwari ukugira ngo ubu, biciye mw’ishengero, abatware n’abafise ububasha b’ahantu ho mw’ijuru bamenye ubwenge butagira urugero bw’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Uwo ni wo mugambi wayo w’ibihe bidashira, uwo yashize mu ngiro biciye muri Kristo Yesu Umwami wacu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Muri we, kandi biciye mu kumwizera dushobora kwegera Imana mu mwidegemvyo kandi tudakekeranya. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ndabasaba rero ngo ntimwihebuzwe n’imibabaro ndiko ndacamwo ku bwanyu, kuko ni icubahiro canyu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo asengera Abanyefeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ni co gituma mpfukama imbere ya Data, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />uwo imiryango yose yo mw’ijuru n’iyo mw’isi ikomokako. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nsaba Imana ko bivuye ku butunzi butagira urugero bw’ubwiza bwayo, yobakomeza mu mitima, mu kubaha ubushobozi biciye muri Mpwemu wayo, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />kugira ngo Kristo abe mu mitima yanyu biciye mu kumwizera. Kandi ndasenga kugira ngo mwebwe, mumaze gushingwa neza mu rukundo rwiwe, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />mugire ubushobozi bubafasha gutahurira hamwe n’abandi bera b’Imana bose: ubwaguke, uburebure, uburebure bw’igihagararo n’ubw’amaja epfo bw’urukundo rwa Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />kandi ngo mumenye urwo rukundo rwa Kristo naho rurengeye uko rwoshobora kumenywa, bitume mu buzima bwanyu mwuzuzwa mushike ku rugezo rwo ku kunengesera kwose mu kumenya Imana.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Nuko rero iyishobora gukora ibirengeye cane ivyo dusaba canke ivyo twiyumvira, nk’uko ubushobozi bwayo bukorera muri twebwe buri, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />icubahiro kibe icayo mw’ishengero no muri Kristo Yesu, uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikira urundi, uhereye ibihe vyose, ukugeza ibihe bidashira! Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubumwe n’ugukura mu mubiri wa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Nuko, Jewe nk’imbohe y’Umwami, ndabinginga ngo mubeho ubuzima bubereye ihamagarwa ryanyu mwahamagawe n’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mwame imisi yose mwicisha bugufi, mugira ubugwaneza kandi mwihanganiranira, ku bw’urukundo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mugire ishaka ryo kuzigama ubumwe bwo muri Mpwemu kandi mufatanywe n’umugozi w’amahoro. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Hari umubiri umwe n’Impwemu imwe, nk’uko mwahamagariwe ivyizigiro bimwe vyo muri kazoza; <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Hari Umwami umwe, ukwizera kumwe, umubatizo umwe; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />kandi hari Imana imwe, ni yo Data wa twese, iri hejuru ya bose, igakorera muri bose kandi ikaba muri bose.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ariko umwe wese muri twebwe yahawe ubuntu nk’uko Kristo yabigenye. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ni co gituma bivugwa ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Hamwe yaduga iyo hejuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">yajanye inyagano nyinshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kandi yatanze ingabire ku bantu biwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Zaburi 68:18</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Mbega “yaraduze” bivuga iki, ko no kumanuka yamanutse agashika i bwina ho mw’isi? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Uwo yamanutse ni we nyene yaduze gushika hejuru ahasumba amajuru yose, kugira ngo yuzure ahantu hose.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Nuko rero Kristo ni we yatanze ingabire mw’ishengero, bamwe abaha kuba intumwa, abandi kuba abavugishwa, abandi kuba abavugabutumwa, abandi kuba abungere n’abigisha, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />kugira ngo bashobore kwigisha abera na bo bakore igikorwa ciwe, bubake ishengero ari ryo mubiri wa Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Ivyo bikwiye kubandanya bikorwa kugeza aho twese tuzoshikira ku kugiriranira ubumwe mu kwizera no mu kumenya neza Umwana w’Imana, no gukura kugeza dushike ku rugezo rwo ku kunengesera kwa Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Aho rero ni ho tutazosubira kumera nk’inzoya ngo dukubebwe tujanwa hirya no hino n’imipfunda, twongera tuzungagizwa n’umuyaga uwo ari wo wose w’inyigisho z’ibinyoma n’urwenge vy’abantu bazimiza. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ahubwo, tuzovuga ukuri mu rukundo, dukure mu buryo bwose, kugeza dushike ku gusa na Kristo, we mutwe w’umubiri ari ryo shengero ryiwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ni we atuma umubiri wose ukomera ugafatanywa neza n’ingingo zawo, ugakura neza kandi ukubakwa mu rukundo, mu gihe urugingo rwose rukoze igikorwa carwo.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyigisho zo kubaho ubuzima Rukristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Nuko ndababwira ibi kandi ndabihanikiriza mw’izina ry’Umwami: ntimukwiye kuguma mubaho nk’uko Abanyamahanga babaho, mu gukurikiza ivyiyumviro vyabo bitagira ikimazi. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ubwenge bwabo buri mu mwijima kandi batandukanijwe n’ubugingo bw’Imana kubera ukutamenya kuri muri bo kuva ku gukomantara kw’imitima yabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Kubera ata kintu kigiteye isoni kuri bo, bisutse mu vy’ubuhumbu maze bakora ibihumanya vy’uburyo bwose, kandi buzuye ukwipfuza kwinshi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ariko mweho si gutyo mwize Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />igihe mwumva maze mukigishwa ivyiwe, mukamenya ukuri kuva muri we. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ku bijanye n’ingeso zanyu za kera, mwarigishijwe kwiyambura kamere k’icaha ari we muntu wanyu wa kera, abozwa n’ivyipfuzo vyiwe vy’uruhendo; <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />ngo mugirwe bashasha na Mpwemu mu vyiyumviro vyanyu no mu myifato; <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />hanyuma mwambare umuntu mushasha, yaremwe ngo ase n’Imana mu bugororotsi bw’ukuri no mu kwezwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nuko rero umwe wese muri mwebwe niyiyambure ibinyoma, muvugane ukuri na bagenzi banyu, kuko turi ingingo zigize umubiri umwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />“Ugushavura kwanyu ntikubakoreshe icaha,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Zaburi 4:4</ref></char></char></note> kandi izuba ntirirenge mugishavuye, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />kuko ishavu riha akaryo wa mubi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Uwiba ntakongere kwiba, ahubwo agire umwete wo gukora ivyiza akoresheje amaboko yiwe, kugira ngo aronke ico gufashisha abakene.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ntihakagire ijambo ribi riva mu kanwa kanyu, ahubwo muvuge amajambo meza yubaka abandi mu vyo bakeneye, kugira ngo agirire akamaro abayumva. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Kandi ntimukababaze Mpwemu Yera w’Imana, uwo mwahawe nk’ikidodo cemeza ko muri abiwe, ku bwa wa musi aho muzocungurirwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Mwiyambure umururazi wose, ubushangashirwe, uburake, ugutongana n’ugutukana, hamwe n’ibindi bibi vyose. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mugiranire neza kandi mubabarane, mwongere muharirane nk’uko Imana yabahariye muri Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Nuko rero mwigane Imana, kuko muri abana bayo ikunda cane, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />kandi mugendere mu nzira y’urukundo, nk’uko Kristo yadukunze akitanga ku bwacu ngo abe ubumote bwiza n’ikimazi bihabwa Imana.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ariko muri mwebwe ntihabemwo ubusambanyi, canke ukwipfuza ukwo ari kwo kwose, canke ubukunzi bw’inda, kuko bidakwiye ku bera b’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ntihakagire ibiterasoni, amajambo y’ubupfu canke ibitwenza bibi bigira ikibanza muri mwebwe, ahubwo habe amashimwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Kuko mukwiye kumenya neza ko: ata munyangeso mbi, uwanduye canke uwukunda inda; umuntu nk’uwo asenga ibigirwamana, azogira ico aragwa mu bwami bwa Kristo n’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ntihagire uwubahendesha amajambo atagira ikimazi, kuko ibintu nk’ivyo bizana uburake bw’Imana ku batayumvira. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Nuko rero ntimukifatanye na bo mu vyo bakora.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Kuko kera mwari mwuzuye umwijima, ariko noneho ubu mufise umuco uva ku Mwami wacu. Nimubeho rero nk’abana b’umuco <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(kuko icamwa c’umuco ni ineza y’uburyo bwose, ukugororoka n’ukuri), <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />kandi mumenye ibihimbara Umwami ivyo ari vyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ntimwifatanye n’ibikorwa vy’impfagusa bikorerwa mu mwijima, ahubwo mubishire ahabona. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Biteye n’isoni kuvuga ivyo abatumvira Imana bakorera mu mpisho. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ariko igishizwe ahabona n’umuco cose gica kiboneka; kandi ikirasiwe n’umuco kiba mu muco. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ni co gituma bivugwa ngo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Ikangure, wewe usinziriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">vyuka uve mu bapfuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">maze Kristo arakumurikira.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Nuko mwirinde cane uko mubaho, ntimwigenze nk’imburabwenge, ahubwo mwigenze nk’abanyabwenge. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Akaryo kose muronse mugakoreshe neza, kuko imisi ari mibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ntimube ibipfu, ariko mutahure ivyo Umwami abashakako ivyo ari vyo. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ntimukaborerwe umuvinyu, kuko bijana abantu mu buhumbu. Ahubwo, mwuzure Mpwemu Yera, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />mubwirane amazaburi n’indirimbo zo guhimbaza ziva kuri Mpwemu. Muririmbe kandi mucurarangire Umwami bivuye mu mitima yanyu, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />mushimira vyose Imana Data imisi yose, mw’izina ry’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyigisho ku ngo z’Abakristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Umwe wese agamburukire mugenziwe abitewe no kwubaha Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Bagore, mwumvire abagabo banyu nk’uko mwumvira Umwami Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Kuko umugabo ari we mutwe w’umugore nk’uko Kristo na we ari we mutwe w’ishengero ari ryo mubiri wiwe, na we akaba umukiza waryo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Nuko rero nk’uko ishengero ryubaha Kristo, ni ko n’abagore bakwiye kwubaha abagabo babo muri vyose.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Bagabo, mukunde abagore banyu, nk’uko Kristo yakunze ishengero akaryigura <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />ngo arigire iryejejwe ritunganye, aryogesheje umwuhagiro w’amazi ari ryo Jambo ry’Imana. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Ivyo yabikoze kugira ngo aryiyegereze ari ishengero rikayangana, ritagira agatosi canke umunkanyari canke akandi gasembwa kose, ariko ryejejwe ritagira umugayo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Muri iyo nzira nyene, abagabo bakwiye gukunda abagore babo nk’imibiri yabo bwite. Uwukunda umugore wiwe abayikunda. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kandi murazi ko ata muntu yoshobora kwanka umubiri wiwe, ariko arawugaburira akawitwararika, nk’uko Kristo abikora kw’ishengero, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />kuko turi ingingo z’umubiri wiwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Ku bw’ivyo, nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga, umugabo azosiga se na nyina abane n’umugore wiwe ubutakivana, maze babe umubiri umwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Itanguriro 2:24</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Iri ni ibanga rihambaye; ariko ni ishusho nziza yerekana ivya Kristo n’ishengero. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Rero, umwe wese muri mwebwe akunde umugore wiwe nk’uko yikunda, kandi umugore na we yubahe umugabo wiwe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Bana, mwumvire abavyeyi banyu kuko muri ab’Umwami, kandi akaba ari vyo bibereye. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Wubahe so na nyoko.” Ni co cagezwe ca mbere gifise isezerano: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“Niwubahe so na nyoko kugira ngo ivyawe bize bigende neza kandi kugira ngo uze urambire kw’isi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:16">Gusubiramwo 5:16</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ba se, ntimuratse abana banyu; ahubwo mubarerere mu ngeso nziza zo kwubaha Umwami.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Bashumba, mwumvire ba shobuja bo mw’isi, mububaha kandi mubatinya, bivuye ku mitima, nk’uko mwokwubaha Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mubumvire igihe cose, atari gusa iyo babahagarikiye. Ariko kuko muri abakozi ba Kristo, mugakora ivyo Imana igomba bivuye ku mitima. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mukorane imitima yanyu yose, nk’aho mwoba muriko mukorera Umwami wacu, mutariko mukorera abantu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />kuko muzi neza ko Umwami azohembera umuntu wese ivyo yakoze, ari umugurano canke uwidegemvya.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Namwe ba shebuja, mugirire abagurano banyu nk’uko nyene. Ntimubatere ubwoba, kuko muzi yuko Shebuja wabo ari we wanyu ari mw’ijuru, kandi ko atarobanura abantu ku butoni.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukwambara ibigwanisho vy’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ijambo rya nyuma: mukomere mu Mwami wacu no mu bushobozi bwiwe bwinshi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mwambare ibigwanisho vyose Imana itanga, kugira ngo mushobore guhangana n’ubugunge bwose bwa wa mubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Kuko mu ntambara yacu ntituriko tugwana n’abafise umubiri n’amaraso, ariko tugwana n’abatware babi, n’abafise ububasha b’ahantu tutabona, n’abanyabushobozi bo mw’isi y’umwijima hamwe rero n’impwemu mbi z’ahantu ho mw’ijuru. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Nuko rero mwambare ibigwanisho vyose vy’Imana, kugira ngo ku musi ikibi caje, muze mushobore guhagarara mudatsinzwe kandi mumaze gukora vyose, mukomeze guhagarara mushikamye. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Nuko mushikame, mukenyeje umukanda w’ukuri, mwambaye icuma gikingira igikiriza ari kwo kugororoka, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />ku birenge vyanyu mwambare ibirato ari kwo kwitegurira kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’amahoro. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Icongeye kuri ivyo vyose, mwitwaze inkinzo y’ukwizera, iyo mushobora kuzimisha imyampi yose yaka umuriro ya wa mubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Mwambare n’inkofero y’agakiza, mwitwaze n’inkota ya Mpwemu, ari ryo jambo ry’Imana.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Kandi musengere muri Mpwemu ibihe vyose kandi mugire amasengesho y’uburyo bwose n’ukwinginga. Hamwe n’ivyo vyose, mwame muri maso kandi mwame musenga ubudasiba musengera abera b’Imana bose. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Kandi nanje munsengere, kugira ngo igihe cose mvuze, mpabwe amajambo kugira ngo menyeshe abantu ibanga ry’Ubutumwa Bwiza ntatinya, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />ubwo mbereye umuserukizi mw’ibohero. Munsengere ngo ndabuvuge ntatinya, nk’uko bikwiye.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiko, umuvukanyi nkunda kandi umukozi w’umwizigirwa mu Mwami, azobabwira vyose, kugira ngo namwe mumenye uko meze n’ivyo ndiko ndakora. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ni muri iyo ntumbero ndamubarungikiye, kugira ngo mumenye uko tumerewe yongere aremeshe imitima yanyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Amahoro abe kuri bene Data, n’urukundo rufatanije n’ukwizera biva ku Mana Data no ku Mwami Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ubuntu bube ku bantu bakundisha Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo urukundo rudahera.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>